{"page":208,"verses":[{"verse_key":"10:1","surah":10,"ayah":1,"ar_uthmani":" الٓر ۚ تِلْكَ ءَايَـٰتُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ ٱلْحَكِيمِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Alif Lam Ra These are the verses of the wise Book.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"الٓر ۚ","en_gloss":"Alif Lam Ra","transliteration":"alif-lam-ra","verse_key":"10:1"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تِلْكَ","en_gloss":"These","transliteration":"til'ka","verse_key":"10:1"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتُ","en_gloss":"(are the) verses","transliteration":"āyātu","verse_key":"10:1"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"10:1"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْحَكِيمِ","en_gloss":"the wise","transliteration":"l-ḥakīmi","verse_key":"10:1"},{"pos":6,"ar":"١","en_gloss":"(1)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"10:1"}]},{"verse_key":"10:2","surah":10,"ayah":2,"ar_uthmani":"أَكَانَ لِلنَّاسِ عَجَبًا أَنْ أَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَىٰ رَجُلٍ مِّنْهُمْ أَنْ أَنذِرِ ٱلنَّاسَ وَبَشِّرِ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓا۟ أَنَّ لَهُمْ قَدَمَ صِدْقٍ عِندَ رَبِّهِمْ ۗ قَالَ ٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ إِنَّ هَـٰذَا لَسَـٰحِرٌ مُّبِينٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Is it so surprising to people that We have revealed to a man from among them that he should warn people, and give glad news to those who believe, that they are on a sure footing with their Lord? [Yet] those who disbelieve say, ‘This man is clearly a sorcerer.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَكَانَ","en_gloss":"Is it","transliteration":"akāna","verse_key":"10:2"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"for the mankind","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","verse_key":"10:2"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَجَبًا","en_gloss":"a wonder","transliteration":"ʿajaban","verse_key":"10:2"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَنْ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"10:2"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَوْحَيْنَآ","en_gloss":"We revealed","transliteration":"awḥaynā","verse_key":"10:2"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"10:2"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رَجُلٍۢ","en_gloss":"a man","transliteration":"rajulin","verse_key":