":3,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ رَبَّكُمُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ فِى سِتَّةِ أَيَّامٍ ثُمَّ ٱسْتَوَىٰ عَلَى ٱلْعَرْشِ ۖ يُدَبِّرُ ٱلْأَمْرَ ۖ مَا مِن شَفِيعٍ إِلَّا مِنۢ بَعْدِ إِذْنِهِۦ ۚ ذَٰلِكُمُ ٱللَّهُ رَبُّكُمْ فَٱعْبُدُوهُ ۚ أَفَلَا تَذَكَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Your Lord is God who created the heavens and earth in six Days, then established Himself on the Throne, governing everything; there is no one that can intercede with Him, unless He has first given permission: this is God your Lord so worship Him. How can you not take heed?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"10:3"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَبَّكُمُ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbakumu","verse_key":"10:3"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(is) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"10:3"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"10:3"},{"pos":5,"ar":"خَلَقَ","en_gloss":"created","transliteration":"khalaqa","verse_key":"10:3"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"10:3"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","verse_key":"10:3"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"10:3"},{"pos":9,"ar":"سِتَّةِ","en_gloss":"six","transliteration":"sittati","verse_key":"10:3"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَيَّامٍۢ","en_gloss":"periods","transliteration":"ayyāmin","verse_key":"10:3"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"10:3"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ","en_gloss":"He established","transliteration":"is'tawā","verse_key":"10:3"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"10:3"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْعَرْشِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the Throne","transliteration":"l-ʿarshi","verse_key":"10:3"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يُدَبِّرُ","en_gloss":"disposing","transliteration":"yudabbiru","verse_key":