e and do good deeds. But the disbelievers will have a drink of scalding water, and agonizing torment, because they persistently disbelieved.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"To Him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"10:4"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَرْجِعُكُمْ","en_gloss":"(will be) your return","transliteration":"marjiʿukum","verse_key":"10:4"},{"pos":3,"ar":"جَمِيعًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"[all]","transliteration":"jamīʿan","verse_key":"10:4"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَعْدَ","en_gloss":"Promise","transliteration":"waʿda","verse_key":"10:4"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"10:4"},{"pos":6,"ar":"حَقًّا ۚ","en_gloss":"(is) true","transliteration":"ḥaqqan","verse_key":"10:4"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, He","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"10:4"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَبْدَؤُا۟","en_gloss":"originates","transliteration":"yabda-u","verse_key":"10:4"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْخَلْقَ","en_gloss":"the creation","transliteration":"l-khalqa","verse_key":"10:4"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"10:4"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُعِيدُهُۥ","en_gloss":"He repeats it","transliteration":"yuʿīduhu","verse_key":"10:4"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لِيَجْزِىَ","en_gloss":"that He may reward","transliteration":"liyajziya","verse_key":"10:4"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"10:4"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believed","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"10:4"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and did","transliteration":"waʿamilū","verse_key":"10:4"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the good deeds","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","verse_key":"10:4"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بِٱلْقِسْطِ ۚ","en_gloss":"in justice","transliteration":"bil-qis'ṭi","verse_key":"10:4"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"But those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"10:4"},{"pos":19,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelie